00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
ABS uses wheel-speed information and controlled brake pressure to help manage wheel slip during braking. It is a feedback system, not a shorter-stopping guarantee on every surface.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Sensor → controller estimate → hydraulic pressure adjustment → new wheel-speed measurement.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Control-loop ordering

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
This ideal mechanism leaves out friction, temperature and part-specific behavior. Real designs need measurements.

